**Honest gaps recorded, not hidden** (FINDINGS.md, 8 items) — notably: the phase evidence's "`rb test` reports 0 tests" is **stale** (it reports 22), but the underlying defect is worse — every one of those 21 "passes" has a fully commented-out body, so they are vacuous; a test with zero assertions still passes; and the `// test` scanner terminates at any line trimming to `end`, so `expect` inside a block is only reachable via `run_source`.

